# Review agents that MAY approve changes to these paths. Read by .github/review-gate/gate.js.
#
# Same syntax as CODEOWNERS: <pattern> <agent> [<agent> ...]
# - The last matching line wins.
# - A line with no agent means no agent may approve that path.
# - A path that no line matches is not agent-approvable.
# - .github/** and CODEOWNERS are never agent-approvable (enforced in code).
#
# Agents: copilot (GitHub Copilot code review)

/backend/   copilot
/client/    copilot
